' UC-FMG-05 — Review Facility Module Change Request

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access module-change review function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify centralized authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present access-denied result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Retrieve pending module-change requests;
  if (Pending requests available?) then (No [EF-02])
    :Present no-Pending-requests notice;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    :Present list of Pending requests;
  endif
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Select module-change request to review;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Retrieve request details;
if (Request exists & still Pending?) then (No [EF-03 / EF-04])
  :Present request unavailable/stale status;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :Present request details & facility module context;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.2 Review request information;
if (Review info valid?) then (No [EF-05])
  |WAHrden System|
  :Present validation issue; hold decision;
  kill
else (Yes)
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Decision type?) then (Approve [3.0])
  :Select Approve;
  |WAHrden System|
  :3.1 Present approval confirmation prompt;
elseif (Modify and Approve [AF-01])
  :Modify details & select Approve;
  |WAHrden System|
  :Validate modifications & present confirmation;
else (Reject [AF-02])
  :Select Reject;
  |WAHrden System|
  :Present rejection confirmation prompt;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Confirm decision?) then (No / Cancel [EF-06])
  :Cancel review action;
  kill
else (Yes [3.2])
  :Confirm decision;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Validate final status against review requirements;
if (Still eligible for decision?) then (No [EF-07])
  :Present decision-not-applicable result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :4.1 Apply decision to request (Status updated);
  if (Processing successful?) then (No [EF-08])
    :Present review-failure result;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    |Database / Audit|
    :4.2 Record review decision & audit trail;
    
    |WAHrden System|
    :4.3 Present resulting decision and status;
  endif
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:Acknowledge review outcome;
stop
@enduml
